# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-"
"inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr ""
"Pasul 1: Maparea intrărilor clasice la o problemă cuantică {#step-1-map-"
"classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now instead of looking for only the lowest eigenvalue of our observables, we"
" will look for all $4$, (where $k=4$).\n"
msgstr ""
"Acum, în loc să căutăm doar cea mai mică valoare proprie a observabilelor "
"noastre, vom căuta toate cele $4$ (unde $k=4$).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Remember that the cost functions of VQD are:\n"
msgstr "Reamintește-ți că funcțiile de cost ale VQD sunt:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"C_{l}(\\vec{\\theta}) :=\n"
"\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta}) | \\hat{H} | \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})\\rangle +\n"
"\\sum_{j=0}^{l-1}\\beta_j |\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})| \\psi(\\vec{\\theta^j})\\rangle  |^2\n"
"\\quad \\forall l\\in\\{1,\\cdots,k\\}=\\{1,\\cdots,4\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"C_{l}(\\vec{\\theta}) :=\n"
"\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta}) | \\hat{H} | \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})\\rangle +\n"
"\\sum_{j=0}^{l-1}\\beta_j |\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})| \\psi(\\vec{\\theta^j})\\rangle  |^2\n"
"\\quad \\forall l\\in\\{1,\\cdots,k\\}=\\{1,\\cdots,4\\}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is particularly important because a vector "
"$\\vec{\\beta}=(\\beta_0,\\cdots,\\beta_{k-1})$ (in this case $(\\beta_0, "
"\\beta_1, \\beta_2, \\beta_3)$) must be passed as an argument when we define"
" the `VQD` object.\n"
msgstr ""
"Acest lucru este deosebit de important deoarece un vector "
"$\\vec{\\beta}=(\\beta_0,\\cdots,\\beta_{k-1})$ (în acest caz $(\\beta_0, "
"\\beta_1, \\beta_2, \\beta_3)$) trebuie transmis ca argument atunci când "
"definim obiectul `VQD`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Also, in Qiskit's implementation of VQD, instead of considering the effective observables described in the previous notebook, the fidelities $|\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})| \\psi(\\vec{\\theta^j})\\rangle  |^2$ are calculated directly via the `ComputeUncompute` algorithm, that leverages a `Sampler` primitive to sample the probability of obtaining $|0\\rangle$ for the circuit\n"
"$U_A^\\dagger(\\vec{\\theta})U_A(\\vec{\\theta^j})$. This works precisely because this probability is\n"
msgstr ""
"De asemenea, în implementarea VQD din Qiskit, în loc să se ia în considerare observabilele efective descrise în lecția anterioară, fidelitățile $|\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})| \\psi(\\vec{\\theta^j})\\rangle  |^2$ sunt calculate direct prin algoritmul `ComputeUncompute`, care utilizează o primitivă `Sampler` pentru a eșantiona probabilitatea de a obține $|0\\rangle$ pentru circuitul\n"
"$U_A^\\dagger(\\vec{\\theta})U_A(\\vec{\\theta^j})$. Aceasta funcționează tocmai pentru că această probabilitate este\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "p_0\n"
msgstr "p_0\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "& = |\\langle 0|U_A^\\dagger(\\vec{\\theta})U_A(\\vec{\\theta^j})|0\\rangle|^2 \\\\[1mm]\n"
msgstr ""
"& = |\\langle "
"0|U_A^\\dagger(\\vec{\\theta})U_A(\\vec{\\theta^j})|0\\rangle|^2 \\\\[1mm]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"& = |\\big(\\langle "
"0|U_A^\\dagger(\\vec{\\theta})\\big)\\big(U_A(\\vec{\\theta^j})|0\\rangle\\big)|^2"
" \\\\[1mm]\n"
msgstr ""
"& = |\\big(\\langle "
"0|U_A^\\dagger(\\vec{\\theta})\\big)\\big(U_A(\\vec{\\theta^j})|0\\rangle\\big)|^2"
" \\\\[1mm]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "& = |\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta}) |\\psi(\\vec{\\theta^j}) \\rangle|^2 \\\\[1mm]\n"
msgstr "& = |\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta}) |\\psi(\\vec{\\theta^j}) \\rangle|^2 \\\\[1mm]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

